{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Ui0qa8QIQx1795758897.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>國常會提出，加力發揮「國家隊」穩市作用，港股升幅曾擴大至逾500點，上試22,700點，上證指數升逾百分之3。</p><p></p><p>[13:27]</p><p>區內股市向好，港股曾升逾200點。</p><p></p><p>恒指高開36點後，最多升逾210點，上試22,400點水平。</p><p></p><p>科網股普遍向上，阿里巴巴升百分之3，重上85元水平，騰訊也升百分之1。</p><p></p><p>晶片股顯著反彈，華虹升百分之9，連同中芯包辦藍籌升幅榜首兩位。</p><p></p><p>個別資源股受壓，配股集資67億元的神華，股價跌百分之6。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T06:43:54.696199+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":209,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T05:53:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T14:28:09.614542+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T06:37:17.399977+00:00","content_hash":"607cedf8bd3143fbcd4e18cd0a16ca6f0f5d96be82e303219a6f0c70d97f4082","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T06:43:54.696199+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}